  "description": "IGEVUP crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C78 H58 Cl2 Dy6 F6 N24 O22,6(C2 H6 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 5 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 5 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.898-4.950 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 112.40-173.27°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C90H94Cl2Dy6F6N24O28. Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
